Z||000000||Fformula88||07-20-2001||10:26 PM||||Just wanted to let everybody know that the POCI is having their local event at Jim Murphy Pontiac in Depew (Buffalo suburb) on Sunday, July 29 next weeken.  There is always a guy there who brings 6 or 7 silver Fieros and generally a few other people.  If I can get my Fiero in decent shape I may show it too.  I wanted to post it in case any of the other local Fiero owners, or some of our Southern Ontario guys would be interested in attending.  I can post more info later if anybody is interested.<P>------------------<BR>John  <BR>AOLIM: Fformula88<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierosig2.JPG"> <BR>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>1985 Fiero SE 2M6||||reg||1
Z||000001||AkursedX||07-20-2001||10:51 PM||||AWESOME!!  I will let all the guys from my Monday night group in Hamilton know about it!  Hopefully they can all make it.  I'm not even sure if I can make it though.  I'm supposed to be out of town for part of that weekend  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  But I think I'm coming back home saturday night!  So If I'm home, and my car is running, I will be there!!<BR><P>------------------<BR><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic2_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||AusFiero||07-20-2001||11:13 PM||||Hey see if you can catch up with Dave Clee. He is a friend of mine and a POCI director. He is over the USA at the moment with POCI commtments. We will probably be around there somewhere. He owns Ponti-World Australia and I am sure you would have a good chat and have a few yarns to tell each other.  <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
Z||000003||Fformula88||07-22-2001||12:16 AM||||If I see him there, I will definately try to get a few words in with him.  Thanks Akursed for spreading the word!  I think it would be awesome to have a good showing there!  ||||reg||1
Z||000004||Old Lar||07-22-2001||10:36 AM||||Where is Jim Murphy's Pontiac located in Depew??  I have a local show the 28th, so my 87 will be nice and clean.  Depew is less than an hour away.  Time, cost, weather forcast (j/k).||||reg||1
Z||000005||Fformula88||07-22-2001||11:51 AM||||Jim Murphy's is ast 3000 Walden Avenue between Transit and Dick Roads.  I dunno how familiar you are with the area, but if you drive in on I-90 get off at transit.  After going thru the toll booth make a right on transit and take it until you get to Walden.  I think it may be the 8th light.  You will know your almost there when the road narrows, losing the middle turning lane.<P>It doesn't give duration time, but says all cars must be on the showfield by noon.  Cost is $10.00 day of, and $8.00 pre-registration.  The contact is Barb at (716) 652-4951.  Weather?  Hopefully nice!<P>||||reg||1
Z||000006||grinthock||07-22-2001||12:19 PM||||I am TOTALLY IN!!  I will talk to BanditBalz he is off that day!  I am gonna go, anyone else from Canada wanna join the Convoy?  The lineup starts at Tim's on Centennial Pkwy and you better take a numba!!<P>Any Canadian's email!||||reg||1
